            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Twiddle 0.8

- Adds Sticky Mode in General settings. When enabled, only clicking the menu-bar icon opens or closes the panel.
- Keeps the panel open when clicking elsewhere, pressing Escape, or opening Settings. Filter shortcuts still work without opening or dismissing the panel.
- Remembers Sticky Mode across app launches; it is off by default.
]]></description>
